    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "凌晨在樓上廁所。電話那頭是芷君。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "zhijun",
      "text": "甚麼！那傢伙明明已經有女朋友了，難道仍然未能放手嗎？",
      "expr": "03-glare"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "zhijun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "我沒有證據，不敢說死。可是那個眼神不是裝的。綺珊性子衝動。我沒有告訴她，也沒有告訴素婷。",
      "expr": "05-fire"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "zhijun",
      "text": "要是素婷並不知道你喜歡她，你有甚麼必要抵毀家綸？",
      "expr": "05-tearsmile"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "zhijun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "將來如果有機會……那就不好辦了。",
      "expr": "01-shrug"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "zhijun",
      "text": "別做夢了。現在不是說這種事的時候。",
      "expr": "04-puff"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "zhijun",
      "text": "要是他不是真心喜歡素婷，是一心喜歡綺珊，卻跟素婷在一起，兩個人都可憐。我替你留意一下。現在他在對面那個爐，開始跟莊員聊了。你可以出來看看。",
      "expr": "04-puff"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "凌晨走回燒烤場。家綸在跟會長小聲說話。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "zhijun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "喂！家綸，會長大人，在聊甚麼？",
      "expr": "01-shrug"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "jialun",
      "text": "沒有在聊甚麼。只是在討論今天晚上可以看到哪些星座。",
      "expr": "05-nod"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "jialun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "今晚烏雲密佈，還討論看得到哪些星座？",
      "expr": "02-blush"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "jialun",
      "text": "所以嘛，我們在討論本來可以看到甚麼。被雲蓋住，可惜。",
      "expr": "01-murmur"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "jialun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "huizhang",
      "text": "今天晚上觀不成星了。吃完飯，你跟我和大鼻到石灘，把望遠鏡收回來，可好？",
      "expr": "03-sharp"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "huizhang"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "家綸，我們一起去吧？",
      "expr": "04-cold"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "jialun",
      "text": "我答應了素婷，一會兒陪她洗碗，不能幫你們。不好意思。",
      "expr": "02-happy"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "jialun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "那麼會長大人，你吃飽再叫我。末將隨時效勞。",
      "expr": "05-fire"
    },
    {
      "kind": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "先回綺珊那邊",
          "jump": "ch15-snap"
        },
        {
          "text": "再站一會",
          "jump": "ch15-watch"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
